{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Spec Steering Post-Verification",
  "description": "After completing any spec task, verify that the steering rules were followed, especially the 5-round review for document generation and the build/test verification for task execution.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "postTaskExecution"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "POST-TASK VERIFICATION: Check if the just-completed task followed steering rules:\n1. If a document was generated (requirements.md/design.md/tasks.md): Were all 5 review rounds performed IN THE CHAT with actual code file reads? If not, perform them now.\n2. If a code task was executed: Was compilation verified? Were tests run?\n3. Check the 遗漏检查清单: SecurityConfig URL, OpenApiConfig tag, application.yml, Dockerfile/docker-compose, 前端导航菜单, 前端路由权限, AuditLog 操作类型\nReport any gaps found."
  }
}